      {
        "id": "RenektonCleave",
        "name": "Cull the Meek",
        "description": "Renekton swings his blade, dealing moderate physical damage to all targets around him, and heals for a small portion of the damage dealt. If he has more than 50 Fury, his damage and heal are increased.",
        "tooltip": "Renekton swings his blade, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + (100% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and restoring <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(2/3/4/5/6 + (2% bonus Attack Damage)) Health</span> per non-champion and <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(12/20/28/36/44 + (17% bonus Attack Damage))</span> per champion hit. He also generates <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">2.5 Fury</span> per non-champion and <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">10 Fury</span> per champion.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Fury Bonus</span>: Damage is increased to <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(90/135/180/225/270 + (140% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and healing is increased to <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(6/9/12/15/18 + (6% bonus Attack Damage)) Health</span> against non-champions and <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(36/60/84/108/132 + (51% bonus Attack Damage)) Health</span> against champions. Does not generate any <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Fury</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Max <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">30 Fury</span> per cast.<br />Restores up to <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">50/75/100/125/150 Health</span> on basic casts.<br />Restores up to <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">200/300/400/500/600 Health</span> on empowered casts.</span>",
