        "tooltip": "Renekton dashes, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(40/70/100/130/160 + (90% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. He generates <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">2 Fury</span> per non-champion and <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">10 Fury</span> per champion hit. Hitting at least one enemy allows Renekton to <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability once for 4 seconds. <br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Fury Bonus</span>: The <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> dash deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(70/115/160/205/250 + (135% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> instead and removes <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">25/27.5/30/32.5/35% Armor</span> for 4 seconds. Does not generate <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Fury</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Max <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">30 Fury</span> per cast.</span>",
